  "tosSection2Content": "You are responsible for safeguarding your login credentials.",
  "tosSection3Title": "3. Use of Service & User Conduct",
  "tosSection3Content": "Do not use the service for illegal purposes, violate YouTube Terms of Service, post abusive content, or harass others. Vocabik enforces zero tolerance for objectionable content and abusive users.",
  "tosSection4Title": "4. Content & Intellectual Property",
  "tosSection4Content": "Video content belongs to original owners on YouTube; Vocabik only creates learning exercises.",
  "tosSection5Title": "5. Payment & Refunds",
  "tosSection5Content": "Premium plans can be canceled anytime; 7-day refund for annual plans.",
