  "privacySummaryContent": "We collect email, display name, and learning data to provide services. We do not sell your data.",
  "privacySection1Title": "1. Information We Collect",
  "privacySection1Content": "Email, display name, pseudonymous identifiers, and learning data (progress, scores, saved vocabulary) to personalize your experience.",
  "privacySection2Title": "2. How We Use Information",
  "privacySection2Content": "Provide learning services, recommend suitable videos, track progress, maintain leaderboards, and send streak reminders (if enabled).",
  "privacySection3Title": "3. Third-Party Services",
  "privacySection3Content": "Google Sign-In, YouTube API Services, Firebase (Crashlytics diagnostics, Cloud Messaging, In-App Messaging), and Google Analytics. By using YouTube-powered features, you agree to the Google Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy).",
