  "privacySection4Content": "We collect necessary authentication tokens and pseudonymous diagnostic crash logs to improve app performance.",
  "privacySection5Title": "5. Your Rights & Data Deletion",
  "privacySection5Content": "You can request account deletion or data inquiry at any time by visiting https://vocabik.com/delete-account or contacting privacy@vocabik.com.",
